WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.950
Section 8.

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:04.512
What real protection looks like.

00:00:04.512 --> 00:00:10.300
A Canadian False Claims Act with financial rewards for whistleblowers who expose fraud.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:14.737
An independent protection agency outside political control.

00:00:14.737 --> 00:00:19.975
Reverse burden of proof — employers must prove reprisal was not a factor.

00:00:19.975 --> 00:00:22.975
Criminal penalties for retaliation.

00:00:22.975 --> 00:00:25.725
These are not radical proposals.

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:29.562
They exist in every allied nation except Canada.
